  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "en": "Google started making Genie 4 available to eligible Google AI Ultra subscribers on November 18. The model runs in Project Genie, a browser tool for building and exploring digital worlds. Users on the Google AI Pro plan can join a waiting list.",
      "zh": "谷歌从 11 月 18 日起，开始向符合条件的 Google AI Ultra 订阅用户推出 Genie 4。这款模型可以在 Project Genie 中使用。Project Genie 是一款可在浏览器中创建和探索数字世界的工具。Google AI Pro 订阅用户可以加入候补名单。",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Google started making Genie 4 available to eligible Google AI Ultra subscribers on November 18.",
          "zh": "谷歌从 11 月 18 日起，开始向符合条件的 Google AI Ultra 订阅用户推出 Genie 4。"
        },
        {
          "en": "The model runs in Project Genie, a browser tool for building and exploring digital worlds.",
          "zh": "这款模型可以在 Project Genie 中使用。Project Genie 是一款可在浏览器中创建和探索数字世界的工具。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Users on the Google AI Pro plan can join a waiting list.",
          "zh": "Google AI Pro 订阅用户可以加入候补名单。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "In Genie 4, users can type a new instruction while they are moving through a scene. A prompt can change the weather or bring a new character into the world without ending the session. Sound is generated as the scene changes, so a character can speak and the surrounding sound can change while people explore.",
      "zh": "在 Genie 4 中，用户可以一边在场景中移动，一边输入新指令。用户可以用一句提示词改变天气，也可以让一个新角色进入场景，无需结束当前会话。声音会随着场景变化即时生成。因此，用户在探索时可以听到角色说话，周围的环境音也会随之变化。",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "In Genie 4, users can type a new instruction while they are moving through a scene.",
          "zh": "在 Genie 4 中，用户可以一边在场景中移动，一边输入新指令。"
        },
        {
          "en": "A prompt can change the weather or bring a new character into the world without ending the session.",
          "zh": "用户可以用一句提示词改变天气，也可以让一个新角色进入场景，无需结束当前会话。"
        },
        {
          "en": "Sound is generated as the scene changes, so a character can speak and the surrounding sound can change while people explore.",
          "zh": "声音会随着场景变化即时生成。因此，用户在探索时可以听到角色说话，周围的环境音也会随之变化。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Google also updated Genie 3, which is still available in the model menu. A single Genie 3 generation now lasts up to three minutes, compared with one minute before. People can join several worlds into a longer trip or make a new world from a 360-degree photo.",
      "zh": "谷歌也更新了 Genie 3，用户仍可在模型菜单中选用它。Genie 3 单次生成的体验最长可持续三分钟，此前最多一分钟。用户可以把多个世界连起来，进行更长时间的探索，也可以用一张 360 度全景照片创建新世界。",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "en": "Google also updated Genie 3, which is still available in the model menu.",
          "zh": "谷歌也更新了 Genie 3，用户仍可在模型菜单中选用它。"
