        {
          "en": "A single Genie 3 generation now lasts up to three minutes, compared with one minute before.",
          "zh": "Genie 3 单次生成的体验最长可持续三分钟，此前最多一分钟。"
        },
        {
          "en": "People can join several worlds into a longer trip or make a new world from a 360-degree photo.",
