        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "The update adds an agent that helps users build a world through conversation. A community gallery lets users explore worlds made by other people and make their own versions. In its model card, Google says details can still change unexpectedly during longer sessions or after several complex edits.",
      "zh": "这次更新还加入了一个智能体，用户可以通过对话让它协助创建世界。用户可以在社区展廊里探索别人创建的世界，也可以在此基础上做出自己的版本。谷歌在模型卡中指出，体验时间较长或连续进行多次复杂编辑后，场景细节仍可能出现意外变化。",
